      "is_best": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello ​<user-mention data-id=\"108329\">@Robinson2007</user-mention> and welcome to the ST community.</p><p>The answer is No. It supports only LTDC interface with no MIPI-DSI host.</p><p>If you need a STM32H7 with MIPI interface. You need to select one of the dual core Graphical line products: STM32H74<strong>7</strong> or STM32H75<strong>7</strong>.</p></div>"
